{"labs": [{"id": 0, "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn9le18ob11re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class= \"strong\"> Vanessa</span>: I'm so hungry. <br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Sally</span>: Peter told me that as soon as he arrives, we are going to an amazing place to eat. I'm looking forward to it. Peter asked, \u201cwhat food are you craving?\u201d<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Vanessa</span>: I don't know Sally. It's Friday and we're busy. The restaurant needs to be run; the staff needs organizing, the schedule needs updating and orders need to be made. I hope this is worth it.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Sally</span>: V. <br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Vanessa</span>: I had extra servers come in and also had an extra bartender come down tonight. <br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Sally</span>: Hmmm. Where did you get those shoes? <br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Vanessa</span>: I got my friend Sally to lend them to me. I got her to lend me this necklace as well.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Sally</span>: Nice. How about the dress?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Vanessa</span>: I got Mr. Versace to sell it to me. <br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Sally</span>: Haha.<br />", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn9le18ob11re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class= \"strong\"> Sally</span>: Peter asked me to ask you,\u201cdo you want to go dancing?\u201d. <br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Vanessa</span>: Sure.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Sally</span>: I hope those shoes won't have hurt your feet by the end of the evening.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Vanessa</span>: Where is he? It's 6:45.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Sally</span>: He said he would be here at 7:00 p.m. He'll be here by then. We are going to have a good time.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Vanessa</span>: I know. I took tomorrow off. So when I get home, I know I will not be working Saturday brunch  and I also won't be working in the evening.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Sally</span>: I took tomorrow off too. So I won't be doing anything.<br />", "id": 2, "time": "26000", "image": "engenn9le18ob11re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class= \"strong\"> Vanessa</span>: Who is making all that noise? <br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Sally</span>: Extraordinary! I am intrigued.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Peter</span>: Ladies, welcome. After tonight, you girls will have eaten the best food, seen the best show around and have danced at the most popular nightclubs in town.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Vanessa</span>: You didn't tell me he was bringing a limo.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Sally</span>: He didn't tell me either.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Peter</span>:  Ladies, let's paint the town red.<br />", "id": 3, "time": "45000", "image": "engenn9le18ob11re2img05.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn9le18ob11re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn9le18ob11re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "type": "WLC", "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about what I will do, what I will be doing or what I will have done.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about solving problems.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can quote other people.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Which friends do you borrow clothes from? Do you lend them clothes as well?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Have you ever had trouble when sharing your stuff or clothes?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "t